# Description
# Backup script for your woeking directory of scripts.

# Usage
# Run to backup all files in your directory.
# This command takes the contents of your home directory, compresses it into a .tar archive, and saves that archive into the ~/bash_course directory.
# The command also names the backup according to the current date and time.

tar -cvf ~/bash_course/my_backup_"$(date +%d-%m-%Y_%H-%M-%S)".tar ~/* 2>/dev/null


